  "工程项目与课程": "Engineering projects and coursework",
  "603视界对2025年9月招新活动的报道列出无人机应用、超声波定向扬声器、植物生长灯和泡茶机。2025年10月的另一篇文章提出帕尔贴制冷、涂层、立体绿化与调整生活方式等应对高温的设想。[2][3]": "603 Vision's report on a September 2025 recruitment event listed drone applications, an ultrasonic directional speaker, a grow light and a tea maker. Another article, published in October 2025, discussed Peltier cooling, coatings, vertical greenery and lifestyle changes as possible responses to hot weather.[2][3]",
  "2026年3月2日，魏子奇在群内分享机器人基础课程笔记。6月23日，群内的机器人运动学讨论涉及雅可比矩阵的定义和奇异性判定。[4]": "On 2 March 2026, Wei Ziqi shared course notes on introductory robotics. A discussion of robot kinematics on 23 June covered the definition of the Jacobian matrix and how to identify singularities.[4]",
  "设备与软件": "Devices and software",
  "2026年8月6日，罗宇伦和魏子奇讨论笔记本电脑的接口数量、USB-C供电和电源适配器重量。10月12日，成员分享603AI和KunCode项目页面。10月27日，DeerPhotos的仓库和发行页链接出现在群聊中。[4]": "On 6 August 2026, Luo Yulun and Wei Ziqi discussed laptop ports, USB-C power and the weight of power adapters. Members shared the 603AI and KunCode project pages on 12 October. Links to the DeerPhotos repository and release page appeared on 27 October.[4]",
  "《鹿群_科技IT话题详细报告》，核心消息筛选与七方向统计。": "Deer Group Technology and IT Discussions: Detailed Report. Selection of core messages and counts for seven categories.",
  "603视界《科技之光》": "603 Vision, “The Light of Technology”",
  "603视界《603欧洲空调困局》（2025年10月15日）": "603 Vision, “Room 603's European Air-Conditioning Dilemma” (15 October 2025)",
  "《鹿群20261126》群聊记录，2026年3月2日、6月23日、8月6日、10月12日及27日。": "Deer Group chat archive, 26 November 2026 export. Messages of 2 March, 23 June, 6 August, and 12 and 27 October 2026.",
